{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-15T01:25:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inefficient Indexing Strategy'. The system is experiencing slow response times due to poorly designed indexing strategies, impacting the Database & Performance area. This is affecting customer CUST-0111, and it's crucial we resolve this to prevent dissatisfaction. @eid_c92d3e03, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270314-1-a56f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270314-1-a56f2"}
