{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f944b0ee", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:25:22", "text": "@here Read about how AI is redefining enterprise search in this article. It covers the impact of AI on improving search relevance and user experience. https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbestechcouncil/2023/ai-redefining-enterprise-search/", "utterranceID": "20260907-15-e8d4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-15-e8d4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:26:00", "text": "The main issue is with integration. It seems inconsistent with third-party apps, leading to incomplete data retrieval.", "utterranceID": "20260930-2-17cfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-2-17cfd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:31:00", "text": "Could it be an API compatibility issue? Maybe the third-party apps updated their APIs.", "utterranceID": "20260930-3-5bf0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-3-5bf0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:32:00", "text": "@eid_abff6bea That's possible. We should check if there have been any recent changes in their API versions.", "utterranceID": "20260930-4-44fbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-4-44fbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:36:00", "text": "Another angle could be operational. Maybe there's a lack of standardized integration protocols.", "utterranceID": "20260930-5-6e84b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-5-6e84b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:40:00", "text": "Good point, David. Standardizing protocols could help reduce these inconsistencies.", "utterranceID": "20260930-6-d4514"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-6-d4514"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:41:00", "text": "Also, the design might be lacking in error handling for integration failures. We should look into that.", "utterranceID": "20260930-7-055f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-7-055f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:46:00", "text": "Agreed, Emma. Better error handling could prevent data retrieval issues from going unnoticed.", "utterranceID": "20260930-8-dd322"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-8-dd322"}
