{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-05-02T19:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! For the AI misinterpretation issue, I suggest we enhance the 'AI Engine' section by including a plan for more diverse training datasets. We should also mention the development of advanced configuration options to handle complex API flows. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260501-1-5f1e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260501-1-5f1e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8558304e", "timestamp": "2026-05-02T19:44:00", "text": "Great point, Alice M.! For the UI complexity, we could add a section under 'Analytics Dashboard' about implementing guided tutorials and onboarding processes. This would help new users get up to speed faster. Maybe even a 'Getting Started' guide? 📚", "utterranceID": "20260501-2-bf982"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260501-2-bf982"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-05-15T16:41:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inaccurate Summary Generation for Non-English Conversations'. The problem is that when summarizing Slack conversations in languages other than English, the summaries are often inaccurate or nonsensical. This affects the AI Model & Language Processing area and impacts our non-English speaking users, leading to potential misunderstandings. @eid_13cb0e90, this one's for you. The impacted customer is CUST-0082.", "utterranceID": "20270515-1-64d95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270515-1-64d95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2027-05-15T16:42:00", "text": "Got it, thanks for the heads-up! I'll dive into the AI model and see what's causing these inaccuracies. I'll keep you all posted on my progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270515-2-bbf30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270515-2-bbf30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-05-15T16:47:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Database Overload Causes Slow Response Times'. During peak usage, the system slows down, delaying summary generation and retrieval. This affects the Database & Performance area and impacts user productivity, leading to dissatisfaction. @eid_4df5d4b7, can you take this one? The impacted customer is CUST-0030.", "utterranceID": "20270515-3-064a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270515-3-064a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2027-05-15T16:51:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into optimizing the database performance to handle peak loads better. Let's aim to improve those response times! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270515-4-0e31f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270515-4-0e31f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-05-15T16:52:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Translation Model Errors'. There are errors in the translation model for non-English text, leading to inaccurate summaries. This also affects the AI Model & Language Processing area and impacts the same customer, CUST-0082. @eid_fa6ec727, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270515-5-01ed9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270515-5-01ed9"}
