{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:21:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Fiona. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the infrastructure setup.", "utterranceID": "20260418-1-c033d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-1-c033d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:22:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. It could be an unstable infrastructure or server issues. We should check the server logs for any anomalies during the reported downtimes.", "utterranceID": "20260418-2-d1621"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-2-d1621"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:23:00", "text": "@eid_798684b4, I agree. Also, we should evaluate our current maintenance and monitoring practices. Maybe they're not adequate enough to catch issues before they cause downtime.", "utterranceID": "20260418-3-d435e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-3-d435e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:26:00", "text": "Alice here. Another angle could be the lack of redundancy and failover mechanisms. If one server goes down, there should be a backup to take over immediately.", "utterranceID": "20260418-4-3108c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-4-3108c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:26:58", "text": "@here Read this article on how Salesforce is integrating AI to enhance data analytics capabilities, a must-read for understanding the future of data-driven decision-making. https://www.forbes.com/sites/salesforce-ai-integration", "utterranceID": "20260316-34-66041"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260316-34-66041"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:27:00", "text": "Ian here. We should also consider setting up alerts for any unusual activity. That way, we can respond faster to potential issues.", "utterranceID": "20260418-5-b75f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-5-b75f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:28:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone. Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of dAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260418-6-67ccb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-6-67ccb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-03-17T00:17:00", "text": "@eid_7f69c513 joined planning-dAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260317-36-b63c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260317-36-b63c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T10:58:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of dAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_4f731d34.", "utterranceID": "20260404-0-349cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-0-349cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_792330e0", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:02:26", "text": "@here Check out this insightful blog on leveraging AI for trend analysis in organizational data. It dives deep into how AI can help businesses stay ahead of the curve. https://towardsdatascience.com/ai-for-trend-analysis-in-business-1234567890ab", "utterranceID": "20260318-39-f1bc7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260318-39-f1bc7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260404-1-174cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-1-174cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:06:00", "text": "The main issue is inconsistent performance, especially during peak usage times. It seems to be affecting productivity.", "utterranceID": "20260404-2-de644"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-2-de644"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:07:00", "text": "Could it be due to insufficient server capacity or resource allocation during high demand?", "utterranceID": "20260404-3-9f931"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-3-9f931"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:09:00", "text": "That's possible, Ian. We should check the server logs to see if there are any resource spikes.", "utterranceID": "20260404-4-fcec7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-4-fcec7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:10:00", "text": "Another angle could be inefficient code or algorithms that don't scale well. Maybe the previous team missed optimizing some parts.", "utterranceID": "20260404-5-4e563"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-5-4e563"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T08:57:00", "text": "@eid_802e8eff created this channel on 2027-03-08 08:57:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20270308-0-6dc2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-0-6dc2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T08:57:00", "text": "@eid_802e8eff joined bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce. Also, @eid_443fee06, @eid_4cede092, @eid_31cb6db5, @eid_fc4619fa, @eid_6cc1a0f6 joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20270308-1-c7659"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-1-c7659"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:34:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270308-0-3f33e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-0-3f33e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:39:00", "text": "First up, we have a problem with 'Cache Misses in Summary Retrieval'. Users are experiencing slow response times due to frequent cache misses, which is impacting their productivity. This affects the Database & Performance area and is reported by customer CUST-0030.", "utterranceID": "20270308-1-5e4af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-1-5e4af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:43:00", "text": "I'm assigning this to @eid_31cb6db5. Can you take a look at this, please?", "utterranceID": "20270308-2-29c0e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-2-29c0e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:45:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the cache issue and see how we can optimize the retrieval process. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270308-3-55ec7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-3-55ec7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:49:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Improper Encryption of API Responses' issue. This is a serious security concern as API responses with summaries of private conversations are not encrypted. This affects the API & Security area and was reported by customer CUST-0093.", "utterranceID": "20270308-4-7d4ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-4-7d4ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:53:00", "text": "Assigning this to @eid_443fee06. Can you ensure our API responses are properly encrypted?", "utterranceID": "20270308-5-d22c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-5-d22c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:57:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize this and make sure our encryption protocols are up to standard. Thanks for flagging this! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270308-6-18717"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-6-18717"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T14:59:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_443fee06! Lastly, there's a 'Faulty Named Entity Recognition' issue. The summarizer is struggling with non-English conversations, leading to inaccurate summaries. This impacts the AI Model & Language Processing area and was reported by customer CUST-0090.", "utterranceID": "20270308-7-14fb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-7-14fb9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T15:00:00", "text": "Assigning this to @eid_6cc1a0f6. Can you look into improving the NER for non-English languages?", "utterranceID": "20270308-8-f487b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-8-f487b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T15:04:00", "text": "On it! I'll review the language processing models and see how we can enhance the NER capabilities. Thanks for the update! 🌍", "utterranceID": "20270308-9-eac5f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-9-eac5f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T15:05:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let's keep our customers happy! If you need any more details, feel free to reach out. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270308-10-d8d1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-10-d8d1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T15:07:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270308-11-ef7d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-11-ef7d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1cb074"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T15:11:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's make it happen. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270308-12-8b737"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-12-8b737"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:53:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as the database's concurrency control mechanisms not being optimized for high levels of parallelism. This was causing high contention for resources during concurrent summarization requests, leading to increased wait times and reduced throughput.", "utterranceID": "20270619-1-32569"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-1-32569"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:57:00", "text": "To resolve this, we implemented a more granular locking strategy and optimized the use of latches to better handle simultaneous requests. This should significantly reduce wait times and improve overall throughput.", "utterranceID": "20270619-2-62423"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-2-62423"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:59:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for the update. I'll run some tests to verify the improvements.", "utterranceID": "20270619-3-e343b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-3-e343b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-20T00:00:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_686130c8. This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing. Let me know if you need any assistance with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20270619-4-5213c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-4-5213c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-20T00:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David. Please let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help!", "utterranceID": "20270619-5-e1e01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-5-e1e01"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:18:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the Concurrency Handling Flaw in SummarizeForce.", "utterranceID": "20270624-0-5a57f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-0-5a57f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:19:00", "text": "The bug was described as SummarizeForce generating summaries based on incomplete data when multiple updates occur simultaneously in a Slack channel.", "utterranceID": "20270624-1-29dbb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-1-29dbb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:20:00", "text": "After reviewing the backend processing, I found that this behavior is actually expected due to the way our system prioritizes real-time updates.", "utterranceID": "20270624-2-a03c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-2-a03c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:25:00", "text": "The system is designed to handle updates as they come, and in cases of simultaneous updates, it processes them in the order they are received, which can lead to partial data summaries.", "utterranceID": "20270624-3-25bca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-3-25bca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:27:00", "text": "This isn't a flaw but rather a trade-off for maintaining low latency in real-time processing.", "utterranceID": "20270624-4-2d5ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-4-2d5ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:28:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. So, no changes are needed on our end?", "utterranceID": "20270624-5-fd04f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-5-fd04f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:29:00", "text": "That's correct, David. No changes are needed. I did a thorough check to ensure that the system is functioning as intended.", "utterranceID": "20270624-6-4b540"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-6-4b540"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:30:00", "text": "If users require more consistent summaries, they might need to adjust their update frequency or use a batch processing feature if available.", "utterranceID": "20270624-7-a22fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-7-a22fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:34:00", "text": "Got it, Alice. I'll communicate this to the users who reported the issue. Thanks for the clarification!", "utterranceID": "20270624-8-03062"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-8-03062"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-24T15:37:00", "text": "You're welcome, @eid_f4f58faa. Let me know if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20270624-9-9e699"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270624-9-9e699"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:52:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20270524-4-070c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-4-070c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:54:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David. Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270524-5-a71ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-5-a71ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:00:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Event Handling' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SummarizeForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20270525-0-876df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-0-876df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:01:00", "text": "The root cause was that event listeners were not properly managed, leading to multiple redundant operations being executed simultaneously, which caused the UI to become sluggish.", "utterranceID": "20270525-1-2d1e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-1-2d1e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:05:00", "text": "To fix this, I consolidated the event listeners and ensured that each event triggers only the necessary operations. This optimization should prevent any redundant processing and improve the UI performance.", "utterranceID": "20270525-2-7af30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-2-7af30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:08:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_e3c15ff5! Thanks for tackling this issue. The sluggishness was really affecting the user experience.", "utterranceID": "20270525-3-68eef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-3-68eef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This should make a big difference. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is smooth now.", "utterranceID": "20270525-4-63467"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-4-63467"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:14:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and David. Let me know if you encounter any further issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20270525-5-d5747"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-5-d5747"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:18:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Appreciate the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20270525-6-cc616"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-6-cc616"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:23:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270529-0-2c3be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-0-2c3be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:25:00", "text": "First up, we have a concurrency control bottleneck issue. High contention for database resources during concurrent summarization requests is causing increased wait times and reduced throughput. This is impacting our Database & Performance area and affecting customer CUST-0090. @eid_686130c8, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270529-1-1de1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-1-1de1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:27:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the database performance and see what's causing the bottleneck. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270529-2-c4e89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-2-c4e89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_686130c8! Next, we have an issue with inconsistent tone and style adaptation. The summarizer isn't maintaining the tone and style for non-English conversations, leading to disjointed summaries. This affects our AI Model & Language Processing and impacts customer CUST-0072. @eid_e3c15ff5, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270529-3-42528"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-3-42528"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_515ae627", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T23:40:00", "text": "Hey @eid_136119e9, thanks for sharing! I'll start reviewing it now. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270207-1-6efe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-1-6efe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T23:44:00", "text": "Thanks for the heads up, @eid_136119e9! I'll take a look at it too. Excited to see how JWT is integrated! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270207-2-0d0a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-2-0d0a2"}
