{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T00:51:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. Could you explain why it's not considered a bug?", "utterranceID": "20270501-2-7f410"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-2-7f410"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T00:52:00", "text": "Sure, David. The behavior is due to a misconfiguration in the user permissions settings on the client side, not an issue with our API layer.", "utterranceID": "20270501-3-ebc7f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-3-ebc7f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T00:57:00", "text": "The API is functioning as expected, but the permissions were not correctly set up by the user, which led to this misunderstanding.", "utterranceID": "20270501-4-b8e70"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-4-b8e70"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T01:02:00", "text": "Got it. So, it's more of a user error than a system error?", "utterranceID": "20270501-5-080e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-5-080e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T01:04:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_f4f58faa. I verified the API logs and ran tests to confirm that the permission checks are working correctly.", "utterranceID": "20270501-6-10abd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-6-10abd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T01:08:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Fiona. I'll inform the user about the correct configuration.", "utterranceID": "20270501-7-b4c2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-7-b4c2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-02T01:09:00", "text": "No problem, David. Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20270501-8-ad147"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270501-8-ad147"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:39:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Session Hijacking Due to Weak Authentication' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SummarizeForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20270524-0-9b8f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-0-9b8f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:41:00", "text": "The root cause was that our authentication mechanism didn't implement robust session management practices. Specifically, it lacked session expiration and regeneration, which made it vulnerable to session hijacking.", "utterranceID": "20270524-1-7da79"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-1-7da79"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:45:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more secure session management system. Now, sessions are set to expire after a period of inactivity, and session IDs are regenerated upon successful login. This should prevent unauthorized access to private channel summaries.", "utterranceID": "20270524-2-23bab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-2-23bab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:48:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. @eid_686130c8", "utterranceID": "20270524-3-4a5f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-3-4a5f3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-15T01:56:00", "text": "Perfect! Let's tackle these issues and make SummarizeForce even better for our users. Thanks, team! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270314-11-82027"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270314-11-82027"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T07:53:00", "text": "Hi team, I found some interesting bugs in open-source projects that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270317-0-e14b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-0-e14b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T07:58:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in PostgreSQL titled 'Suboptimal Query Plan for Complex Joins'. Users are experiencing slow query execution due to inefficient query plans for complex joins. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/84. @eid_c92d3e03, this seems similar to our 'Inefficient Indexing Strategy' issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270317-1-f5636"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-1-f5636"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c92d3e03", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T08:00:00", "text": "Thanks, George! This is definitely relevant. I'll review their approach to optimizing query plans and see if we can apply similar strategies to our indexing problem. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270317-2-a48ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-2-a48ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T08:02:00", "text": "Great! Next, there's a Redis bug titled 'Stale Cache Data on Node Failover'. During node failover, clients get outdated data due to improper cache invalidation. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/85. Bob, this might be useful for our 'Stale Data Cache Issue'.", "utterranceID": "20270317-3-19dd1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-3-19dd1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T08:04:00", "text": "Absolutely, George! I'll dive into their cache invalidation strategy and see how we can improve our real-time data fetching. Thanks for the link! 😄", "utterranceID": "20270317-4-84bcb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-4-84bcb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T08:05:00", "text": "Awesome! Lastly, there's an OAuth2 Proxy issue titled 'Improper Token Scope Validation'. API tokens aren't correctly scoped, which could allow unauthorized access. Here's the PR: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/86. Fiona, this seems to align with our 'Token Mismanagement' issue.", "utterranceID": "20270317-5-4bb0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-5-4bb0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96bfd9b", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T08:08:00", "text": "Thanks, George! I'll review their token scope validation improvements and see how we can enhance our security measures. Security first! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270317-6-4adb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-6-4adb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-03-17T08:13:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these insights in mind as we work on our issues. Feel free to share any findings or ask for help. Collaboration is key! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270317-7-2981b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270317-7-2981b"}
