{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobmiller-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c6eeee"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dcd309f0", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T18:33:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! This Grafana issue sounds a lot like what we're seeing with MonitorForce. I'll dig into their PR to see how they approached the fix. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260824-2-ead21"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-2-ead21"}
