{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-12T07:26:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Improper Validation of User Permissions'. The API isn't correctly validating user permissions, which could also lead to unauthorized data exposure. This is also under API Security & Access Control. Customer ID: CUST-0044. @eid_8175da95, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261212-3-21bfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-3-21bfd"}
