{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T20:06:00", "text": "Great point, George. We should also consider adding user feedback on integration experiences to ensure we're addressing real-world issues. This could be part of the 'Operational' improvements in the report. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260910-4-2343c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-4-2343c"}
