{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:28:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 We need to address the performance, documentation, integration, reliability, and UI concerns. @eid_6f719d21, @eid_b67edbb4, @eid_35e32fec, @eid_8c71a7a9, @eid_ad0725a2, @eid_2490c02c, please share your thoughts and suggestions.", "utterranceID": "20260626-0-b297f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-0-b297f"}
